Package: PLSsemLab
Title: Partial Least Squares Structural Equation Modeling Lab for jamovi
Version: 0.0.0
Authors@R: person("Arquímedes De León", "Chacón Chacón", email = "arquimedeschacon@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(affiliation = "Universidad Católica Andrés Bello (UCAB), Caracas, Venezuela"))
Description: A jamovi module, in development, for partial least squares
    structural equation modeling (PLS-SEM) with the cSEM package. Models are
    built from option boxes and validated before estimation; every result is
    paired with evidence-based methodological guidance, plain-language
    interpretation and educational support.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    jmvcore,
    R6,
    cSEM (>= 0.7.1),
    lavaan,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr
Encoding: UTF-8
